#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:7
msgid ""
"Distributed Workers are an Advanced+ feature, available in HPE Morpheus "
"Enterprise and Advanced tiers."
msgstr ""
"Distributed Workers son un Advanced+ característica, disponible en HPE "
"Morpheus Enterprise y Advanced tiers."

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:10
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:12
msgid ""
"The |morpheus| distributed worker is installed using the same package as the"
" VDI Gateway worker. Organizations which have already deployed VDI "
"Gateway(s) can use the same worker for both purposes if desired, you'd "
"simply need to update configuration in ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus-worker.rb`` "
"and run a reconfigure. When creating a distributed worker or VDI Gateway "
"object in |morpheus| UI, an API key is generated. Adding one or both types "
"of API keys to the worker configuration file determines if the worker is "
"running in VDI gateway and/or distributed worker mode."
msgstr ""
"El |morpheus| distributed worker es installed usando el mismo paquete as el "
"VDI Gateway worker. Organizations que tienen already deployed VDI Gateway(s)"
" puede usar el mismo worker para both purposes si desired, usted'd simply "
"need a update configuración en ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus-worker.rb`` y run a "
"reconfigure. Cuando creando a distributed worker o VDI Gateway object en "
"|morpheus| UI, un API key es generated. Adding uno o both tipos de API keys "
"a el worker configuración file determina si el worker es running en VDI "
"gateway y/o distributed worker mode."

