#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:28
msgid ""
"A distributed worker VM is installed and configured similarly to a "
"|morpheus| appliance via ``rpm`` or ``deb`` package."
msgstr ""
"Un distributed worker VM es installed y configurado similarly a a |morpheus|"
" appliance a través de ``rpm`` o ``deb`` paquete."

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:30
msgid ""
"Package URLs for the distributed worker are available at "
"https://app.morpheushub.com in the downloads section."
msgstr ""
