#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:113
msgid ""
"With the API key in hand and configuration complete in |morpheus| UI, head "
"back to the worker box. Configure the gateway by editing "
"``/etc/morpheus/morpheus-worker.rb`` and updating the following:"
msgstr ""
"Con el API key en hand y configuración complete en |morpheus| UI, head back "
"a el worker box. Configure el gateway por editing ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus-"
"worker.rb`` y updating lo siguiente:"

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:115
msgid ""
"worker_url = 'https://gateway_worker_url' # This is the worker URL the Morpheus appliance can resolve and reach on 443\n"
"worker['appliance_url'] = 'https://morpheus_appliance_url' # The resolvable URL or IP address of Morpheus appliance which the worker can reach on port 443\n"
"worker['apikey'] = 'API KEY FOR THIS GATEWAY' # VDI Gateway API Key generated from Morpheus Appliance VDI Pools > VDI Gateways configuration. For worker only mode, a value is still required but can be any value, including the 'API KEY FOR THIS GATEWAY' default template value\n"
"worker['worker_key'] = 'DISTRIBUTED WORKER KEY' # Distributed Worker API Key from Administration > Integrations > Distributed Workers configuration\n"
"worker['proxy_address'] = 'http://proxy.address:1234' # For environments in which the worker must go through a proxy to communicate with the Morpheus appliance or other resources, configure the address\n"
"worker['no_proxy'] = 'vcenter.example.com,192.168.xx.xx' # A comma-separated list of resources that should be accessed directly and not through the proxy"
msgstr ""
"worker_url = 'https://gateway_worker_url' # Este es el worker URL el Morpheus appliance puede resolve y reach en 443\n"
"worker['appliance_url'] = 'https://morpheus_appliance_url' # El resolvable URL o IP address de Morpheus appliance que el worker puede reach en port 443\n"
"worker['apikey'] = 'API KEY FOR THIS GATEWAY' # VDI Gateway API Key generated desde Morpheus Appliance VDI Pools > VDI Gateways configuración. Para worker solo mode, a valor es still requerido pero puede ser cualquier valor, incluyendo el 'API KEY FOR THIS GATEWAY' predeterminado template valor\n"
"worker['worker_key'] = 'DISTRIBUTED WORKER KEY' # Distributed Worker API Key desde Administración > Integraciones > Distributed Workers configuración\n"
"worker['proxy_address'] = 'http://proxy.address:1234' # Para entornos en que el worker debe go a través de a proxy a communicate con el Morpheus appliance o otro recursos, configure el address\n"
"worker['no_proxy'] = 'vcenter.ejemplo.com,192.168.xx.xx' # Un comma-separated lista de recursos ese debería ser accessed directly y no a través de el proxy"

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:124
msgid ""
"By default the worker_url uses the machine's hostname, ie "
"``https://your_machine_name``. The default ``worker_url`` value can be "
"changed by editing ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus-worker.rb`` and changing the "
"value of ``worker_url``. Additional appliance configuration options are "
"available below."
msgstr ""
"Por predeterminado el worker_url uses el machine's hostname, ie "
"``https://your_machine_name``. El predeterminado ``worker_url`` valor puede "
"ser changed por editing ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus-worker.rb`` y changing el "
"valor de ``worker_url``. Additional appliance configuración opciones están "
"disponibles below."

